### TiendaBox - Pruebas del recurso Product
### Ejecutar en orden. Crea su propia categoria y marca de prueba (con un
### sufijo {{$timestamp}} para poder correr el archivo mas de una vez sin
### chocar con nombres ya usados) y reutiliza el token del owner y los ids
### generados automaticamente, sin copiar y pegar nada.
### GET son publicos; POST/PUT/DELETE requieren login como owner.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Login owner -> 200 OK
# @name loginOwner
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tiendabox.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 0.1 Crear categoria de prueba (owner) -> 201 Created
# @name createCategory
POST {{host}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Notebooks Test {{$timestamp}}"
}

### 0.2 Crear marca de prueba (owner) -> 201 Created
# @name createBrand
POST {{host}}/api/brand
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Apple Test {{$timestamp}}"
}

### 1. Crear producto tipo stock (owner) -> 201 Created
# @name createProduct
POST {{host}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Macbook Pro 14",
  "description": "Laptop de Apple con chip M1 Pro",
  "type": "stock",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stock": 10,
  "category_id": "{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}",
  "brand_id": "{{createBrand.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 2. Crear producto tipo encargo (owner) -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Iphone 17 Pro",
  "type": "encargo",
  "category_id": "{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}",
  "brand_id": "{{createBrand.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 3. Crear producto sin token -> 401 No autenticado
POST {{host}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin auth",
  "type": "stock",
  "price": 10,
  "stock": 1,
  "category_id": "{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}",
  "brand_id": "{{createBrand.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 4. Crear producto tipo stock SIN price (owner) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Producto sin precio",
  "type": "stock",
  "stock": 5,
  "category_id": "{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}",
  "brand_id": "{{createBrand.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 5. Crear producto con type invalido (owner) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/product
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Producto invalido",
  "type": "otro",
  "category_id": "{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}",
  "brand_id": "{{createBrand.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### 6. Listar todos los productos (publico) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 7. Filtrar por category_id (publico) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/products?category_id={{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. Filtrar por brand_id (publico) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/products?brand_id={{createBrand.response.body.$.id}}

### 9. Obtener producto por id (publico) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/product/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}

### 10. Obtener producto inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/product/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 11. Actualizar precio y stock (owner) -> 200 OK
PUT {{host}}/api/product/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "price": 79.5,
  "stock": 5
}

### 12. Cambiar de stock a encargo, fuerza price=null y stock=0 (owner) -> 200 OK
PUT {{host}}/api/product/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "type": "encargo"
}

### 13. Actualizar producto sin token -> 401 No autenticado
PUT {{host}}/api/product/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1
}

### 14. Baja logica del producto, soft delete (owner) -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/product/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

### 15. Borrar de nuevo el mismo producto -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{host}}/api/product/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}
